@startuml
title Конфигурация и секреты ShareTrip
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "ConfigMap\nsharetrip-config" as tripConfig
rectangle "Secret\nsharetrip-secret" as tripSecret
rectangle "Deployment\nsharetrip\nConfig.Load()" as trip
tripConfig --> trip : env
tripSecret --> trip : env

rectangle "ConfigMap\ncontract-config" as contractConfig
rectangle "Secret\ncontract-secret" as contractSecret
rectangle "Deployment\ncontract\nConfig.Load()" as contract
contractConfig --> contract : env
contractSecret --> contract : env

rectangle "ConfigMap\nnotification-config" as notificationConfig
rectangle "Secret\nnotification-secret" as notificationSecret
rectangle "Deployment\nnotification\nConfig.Load()" as notification
notificationConfig --> notification : env
notificationSecret --> notification : env

note bottom of trip
  Проверка обязательных настроек до старта.
  Числа преобразуются в int/time.Duration.
  Секреты не выводятся в лог.
end note
note bottom of notification
  После изменения env:
  apply ConfigMap/Secret,
  затем rollout restart Deployment.
end note
@enduml
